<title>UK: SOCCER-WEST HAM SIGN ISRAEL INTERNATIONAL BERKOVIC.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WEST HAM SIGN ISRAEL INTERNATIONAL BERKOVIC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Ham said on Monday they had signed Israel international Eyal Berkovic from Southampton for 1.75 million pounds ($2.9 million).</p>
<p>Berkovic, who signed a five-year contract, moves to the east London premier league club alongside Andy Impey who transferred from first division Queens Park Rangers in west London for 1.2 million pounds.</p>
<p>($ = 0.611 British Pounds)</p>
